  stmt_return_err_needs_value.pcpp - break step of stmt_return.pcpp:
  return with no value in a function (SM0610)

  How to check, from repo\bin:
    pcpp res\tests\stmt_return_err_needs_value.pcpp
    pcpp res\tests\stmt_return_err_needs_value.pcpp -t x86_64-linux-gnu
  The marked line reports that code; nothing else is reported.
